{"4759410": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Parkour & Freerunning", "steam_appid": 4759410, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Run, jump, swim, dive, climb, wall-run, vault, roll, flip, balance, crouch, crawl, walk, slide, bounce, hang, swing, zipline, and more through hand-crafted and randomly generated locations and challenges for a new experience every time!  Enjoy unlimited, re-playable time trials, races, trick score, tag, hide and seek, follow the leader, &quot;collect-a-gem&quot;, hidden objects, mazes, puzzles, and more!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play together or against each other in localized 2 player challenges!  (All of the challenge types listed above are available for 2 players or single!)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore open worlds with no borders!  Wildlife roaming the landscape with a dynamic weather system of day, night, dawn, dusk, rain, clouds, and fog with the option to turn off scenery or shadows to greatly optimize performance for lower end machines!  Pickup wild edibles and catch small animals to replenish your health and energy!  Hidden objects randomly scattered around every location!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Accumulate Career Points (CP) from winning challenges to unlock new locations.  Collect Attribute Gems (AG) to upgrade your characters speed, strength, endurance, toughness, and intelligence!  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Speed:  Increases movement and tricking</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Strength:  Increases jump height and ability to handle higher falls</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Endurance:  Gain more energy and oxygen</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Toughness:  Heal faster and take less damage from falls</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Intelligence:  Acquire more Career Points (CP) per activity completed </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Manage health, energy, and oxygen levels!  If you fall from too high you get hurt, if you sprint for too long you run out of energy, and if you stay underwater for too long you lose oxygen!  Beware of fire, cacti, and lava!  Every action has consequences!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Check your map for the best route to your next checkpoint or use as a non-fast paced, relaxing gameplay method to find hidden objects!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In depth Mayan themed tutorial/training location to teach beginner's how to play the game!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Primarily designed to be played in third person but first-person, look-back, and top-down orthographic point of views are also available!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Customize the appearance of your character!  Skin, eyes, hair, top/bottom clothing, and shoes (Or no shoes!)  Progress and customization is automatically saved!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Included park creator/editor to create a Parkour &amp; Freerunning park of your own!  Localized sharing of custom parks is also available!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >More than just parkour!  4 wheeling challenges and even a new sport; &quot;Parkball!&quot;  A mix of parkour, football, and golf!  Simply get kick the ball to the goal through whatever obstacles are in the way!  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Many more surprises await as you explore and keep moving forward!</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Run, jump, swim, dive, climb, wall-run, vault, roll, flip, balance, crouch, crawl, walk, slide, bounce, hang, swing, zipline, and more through hand-crafted and randomly generated locations and challenges for a new experience every time!  Enjoy unlimited, re-playable time trials, races, trick score, tag, hide and seek, follow the leader, &quot;collect-a-gem&quot;, hidden objects, mazes, puzzles, and more!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play together or against each other in localized 2 player challenges!  (All of the challenge types listed above are available for 2 players or single!)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore open worlds with no borders!  Wildlife roaming the landscape with a dynamic weather system of day, night, dawn, dusk, rain, clouds, and fog with the option to turn off scenery or shadows to greatly optimize performance for lower end machines!  Pickup wild edibles and catch small animals to replenish your health and energy!  Hidden objects randomly scattered around every location!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Accumulate Career Points (CP) from winning challenges to unlock new locations.  Collect Attribute Gems (AG) to upgrade your characters speed, strength, endurance, toughness, and intelligence!  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Speed:  Increases movement and tricking</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Strength:  Increases jump height and ability to handle higher falls</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Endurance:  Gain more energy and oxygen</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Toughness:  Heal faster and take less damage from falls</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Intelligence:  Acquire more Career Points (CP) per activity completed </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Manage health, energy, and oxygen levels!  If you fall from too high you get hurt, if you sprint for too long you run out of energy, and if you stay underwater for too long you lose oxygen!  Beware of fire, cacti, and lava!  Every action has consequences!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Check your map for the best route to your next checkpoint or use as a non-fast paced, relaxing gameplay method to find hidden objects!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In depth Mayan themed tutorial/training location to teach beginner's how to play the game!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Primarily designed to be played in third person but first-person, look-back, and top-down orthographic point of views are also available!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Customize the appearance of your character!  Skin, eyes, hair, top/bottom clothing, and shoes (Or no shoes!)  Progress and customization is automatically saved!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Included park creator/editor to create a Parkour &amp; Freerunning park of your own!  Localized sharing of custom parks is also available!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >More than just parkour!  4 wheeling challenges and even a new sport; &quot;Parkball!&quot;  A mix of parkour, football, and golf!  Simply get kick the ball to the goal through whatever obstacles are in the way!  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Many more surprises await as you explore and keep moving forward!</p>", "short_description": "Run, jump, swim, dive, climb, wall-run, vault, roll, flip, balance, crouch, crawl, walk, slide, hang, swing, zipline, and more through hand-crafted and randomly generated locations and challenges!  Enjoy unlimited, re-playable time trials, races, trick score, tag, hide &amp; seek, and a whole lot more!!", "supported_languages": "English", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4759410/1ebe210357e9cbde91c34733b4ab9046cd980c81/header.jpg?t=1788219466", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4759410/790a037a91d5dc4e2bc3b520c96ab9fc9ea47588/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1788219466", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/ste